      <trans-unit id="DIb7Deb" resname="Once four friends gathered, each with their own. experience and views, and decided that it was time for something. change. That's how the platform was born, which became. a real bridge between groomers and their customers.">
        <source>Once four friends gathered, each with their own. experience and views, and decided that it was time for something. change. That's how the platform was born, which became. a real bridge between groomers and their customers.</source>
        <target>Якось зібрались четверо друзів, кожен зі своїм досвідом і поглядами, і вирішили, що пора щось змінювати. Так і народилася платформа, яка стала справжнім містком між грумерами та їхніми клієнтами.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="BIr9qEZ" resname="Now you can easily find a professional who is right. just for you, and you no longer need to run around all the salons of the city. spending time searching and comparing. You just choose. comfortable, decent and experienced groomer — and that's it!">
        <source>Now you can easily find a professional who is right. just for you, and you no longer need to run around all the salons of the city. spending time searching and comparing. You just choose. comfortable, decent and experienced groomer — and that's it!</source>
        <target>Тепер можна легко знайти професіонала, який підходить саме тобі, і не потрібно більше бігати по всіх салонах міста, витрачаючи час на пошуки та порівняння. Ти просто обираєш зручного, порядного та досвідченого грумера — і все!</target>
      </trans-unit>
